  enquiry: '/contact/?service=ai-search-readiness#contactForm',
  lead: [
    "People now ask Google's AI answers, ChatGPT and similar tools which supplier to choose. Those tools draw on your website and on what other sites say about you. We check what they currently say, find what is missing or wrong, and improve the pages and facts behind it.",
    'This is sometimes called generative engine optimisation (GEO) or answer engine optimisation (AEO). It is an addition to SEO and depends on it: a page that Google cannot crawl or trust will not be quoted by an AI tool either.',
