      h2: 'What you receive',
      html: `<dl class="bf-deliverables">
<dt>Visibility check</dt><dd>We put an agreed set of buyer questions to the main AI tools on stated dates and record what they say about you and your competitors.</dd>
<dt>Referral report</dt><dd>Visits arriving from AI tools, taken from your analytics and shown separately from ordinary search.</dd>
