<li><span class="bf-num">Emily Bridalwear</span><span class="bf-what">UK bridal retailer</span><a class="bf-src" href="/case-studies/ai-bridal-ecommerce-geo/">Read the review</a></li>
<li><span class="bf-num">Lost Dutchman Leather</span><span class="bf-what">Leather goods store</span><a class="bf-src" href="/case-studies/ai-leather-goods-ecommerce-geo/">Read the review</a></li>
<li><span class="bf-num">Newbury Self Store</span><span class="bf-what">Self storage</span><a class="bf-src" href="/case-studies/ai-self-storage-geo/">Read the review</a></li>
